TOOLTIP:NetForm
"Regulars: everyone with 3 or more games in the last 30 days. Top tier is their best third, Rough patch their worst third. The dots are your last 5 games, oldest first."
END

TOOLTIP:NetFormPing
"Ping to the other players: the middle link of each game, so one far away player does not count against you."
END

TOOLTIP:NetFormDirect
"Share of your links that did not need a relay server. A relayed link only counts against the player who needed relays with everyone."
END

TOOLTIP:NetFormLagCaused
"Freeze time the game spent waiting on you, per game. Only waits longer than 0.1 s count, and 1v1 games are left out."
END

TOOLTIP:NetFormFps
"Frames per second your PC kept up. The slowest PC sets the speed for everyone."
END

TOOLTIP:NetFormHeldBack
"Share of the game you were the slowest PC and under 54 fps."
END

TOOLTIP:NetFormDrawMs
"Time per frame spent on input, interface and drawing."
END

TOOLTIP:NetFormSimMs
"Time per frame spent on the game simulation."
END

